# SELinux type enforcement for cella-doctor
#
# Superseded by selinux.cil in this directory: the enforced policy
# (1.6.14c). CIL, not TE+M4 -- this host has no selinux-policy-devel
# refpolicy headers to expand macros like domain_type(); CIL loads
# straight through `semodule -i` on any targeted-policy host. See
# selinux.cil here and security/selinux/cella-base.cil for the
# shared types and the per-persona domain macro.
